==English==

===Verb===
{{infl|en|verb|head=[[bite]] off [[more]] than one can [[chew]]}}

# {{idiom}} To try to do too much; to [[take on]] or [[attempt]] more than one is capable of doing.
#: ''I think I may have '''bitten off more than I can chew''' when I agreed to paint a two-story house by myself.''

